# pnpm 11 reads ONLY auth/registry keys from .npmrc. Every setting that used to live
# here (shamefully-hoist, engine-strict, auto-install-peers, strict-peer-dependencies,
# enable-pre-post-scripts, public-hoist-pattern) is now in pnpm-workspace.yaml.
#
# Do not re-add them here: pnpm silently ignores them. That is how root node_modules
# ended up with 8 entries instead of 613, which broke every hoist-dependent gate
# (typecheck:web could not find vue-tsc; check-locale-parity could not find typescript).
# Verify with: pnpm config get shamefullyHoist   ->   must print true, not undefined
#
# See pnpm-workspace.yaml and https://pnpm.io/settings
